                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The One Big Beautiful Bill Act is a WIN for Rural America:\n\n\u2705Strengthens the farm safety net.\n\u2705Invests in crop insurance.\n\u2705Prevents the Death Tax from devastating family-owned farms.\n\u2705Reduces barriers to agricultural trade.",
